## Components
- `src/memory/manager.rs` — `MemoryManager` orchestrator
- `src/memory/mod.rs` — `MemoryHandle` (working memory)
- `src/memory/episodic.rs` — Event storage
- `src/memory/vector.rs` — Vector embeddings + similarity

## Responsibilities
- Inject context into LLM prompts
- Store beliefs (`beliefs.json`)
- Provide short-term + long-term recall

